OL,3,GNEWSAEx-officer would have been sacked
OL,4,Afor drink driving
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former police constable who was
OL,7,Fcaught drink driving would have been
OL,8,Fsacked had he not already resigned, a
OL,9,Fmisconduct hearing has heard.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Police said Fraser
OL,12,FDunbar was arrested on suspicion of
OL,13,Fdrink driving on 5 June, after tests
OL,14,Fshowed he had 51 micrograms of alcohol
OL,15,Fin 100 millilitres of breath, compared
OL,16,Fwith a legal limit of 35 micrograms.
OL,18,FAt Derby Magistrates' Court on 1 July,
OL,19,FDunbar, 42, pleaded guilty to drink
OL,20,Fdriving and was banned for 12 months
OL,21,Fand fined #300.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
