OL,3,GNEWSAEx-officer would have been sacked
OL,4,Afor drink driving
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Friday, an accelerated misconduct
OL,7,Fhearing at the force's headquarters at
OL,8,FSherwood Lodge found he had breached
OL,9,Fthe standards of professional
OL,10,Fbehaviour.
